config 88XXAU
	tristate "Realtek 8812AU/8821AU/8814AU USB WiFi (aircrack-ng driver, monitor mode + injection)"
	depends on USB && CFG80211
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	help
	  Out-of-tree aircrack-ng rtl8812au driver (v5.6.4.2 branch) that
	  supports RTL8812AU, RTL8821AU and RTL8814AU USB adapters, including
	  monitor mode and packet injection.

	  Source: https://github.com/aircrack-ng/rtl8812au

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called 88XXau.
